msgid ""
"A Function is a PHP file that returns a callable; Runner calls it with the Flow's shared context:\n"
"\n"
"  return function (array &$context): mixed { ... };\n"
"\n"
"- condition: true runs the Step's activity, call or jump; false skips them.\n"
"- activity: what it returns is kept in $context[<the Step's id>].\n"
"- module: the folder of a Step's condition and activity (not a Block).\n"
"- $context['_importer']('name', 'module') gives another Function's callable.\n"
"Any PHP is fine inside: Composer's autoload, other files, other Functions."
msgstr ""
"Una Function es un archivo PHP que devuelve un callable; Runner lo llama con el contexto compartido del Flow:\n"
"\n"
"  return function (array &$context): mixed { ... };\n"
"\n"
"- condition: true ejecuta la activity, el call o el jump del Step; false los salta.\n"
"- activity: lo que devuelve se guarda en $context[<el id del Step>].\n"
"- module: la carpeta de la condition y la activity de un Step (no es un Block).\n"
"- $context['_importer']('name', 'module') da el callable de otra Function.\n"
"Dentro vale cualquier PHP: el autoload de Composer, otros archivos, otras Functions."

